 결과: 읽기 요청 또는 완성안&lt;br&gt;채택/외부 실행은 코드가 검사" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="874" y="1440" width="362.92" height="82.95" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e52" value="채택 의미/질문/실제 게시 기록 저장" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#195FBD;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="864" y="2070" width="326.96" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e53" value="위와 아래 원통은 같은 상태&lt;br&gt;Controller 소유, State Store 보관" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="874" y="2250" width="359.0" height="54.6" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e56" value="미해결: 질문 전달 요청" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="119" y="2035" width="214.64" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e58" value="실제 게시 기록 반환" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="539" y="2085" width="185.48" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e59" value="Response Manager → Interaction Manager: 질문 표시/음성; 실제 게시 기록 반환&lt;br&gt;사용자 답변은 Interaction Manager → 상단 Request Controller로 새 입력" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="94" y="2250" width="784.52" height="54.6" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e62" value="발화/시점 전달; 신규/보완 관계는 미결정" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="129" y="530" width="374.12" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e64" value="유리: 자유로운 새 의도를 전체 맥락에서 다시 구성&lt;br&gt;대가: 앞선 조건 누락을 검증해야 함; 관련 근거 재해석&lt;br&gt;선택: 짧거나 표현 범위가 넓은 대화" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=23;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="79" y="2365" width="633.6" height="123" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e65" value="B  조회/추론 뒤 지속 의미 상태 구성" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=30;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1312" y="285" width="565.4" height="46.5" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e67" value="초기 안내는 같은 범위. 관련 업무는 미결정; 모든 과거 자료를 넣지 않음." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=20;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1342" y="580" width="741.6" height="33.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e72" value="추론 입력" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2127" y="980" width="91.16" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e74" value="결과" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2327" y="1025" width="44.0" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e76" value="모델 입력" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1972" y="865" width="91.16" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e78" value="모델 결과" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1972" y="910" width="91.16" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e80" value="1  관계 미결정 원문 + 같은 초기 안내" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1377" y="800" width="353.6" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e86" value="2  모델이 관계와 변경 제안; 신규/보완을 미리 정하지 않음" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1377" y="1065" width="537.92" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e88" value="의미/자료/Task 조회" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1347" y="1145" width="194.12" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e90" value="읽기 결과로 재추론" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1347" y="1025" width="174.32" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e92" value="채택한 변경만 적용" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1462" y="1475" width="174.32" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e94" value="이전 버전" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1822" y="1530" width="91.16" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e96" value="3  후보/제약" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1962" y="1300" width="124.64" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e98" value="관계/미해결" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1962" y="1410" width="109.16" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e99" value="적용기와 Engine: 코드/명시 규칙&lt;br&gt;말뜻/조회 선택: Interpreter의 Omni&lt;br&gt;상태 소유: Workspace Component" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2122" y="1480" width="357.2" height="78.9" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e102" value="4  의미/질문/근거 버전" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1367" y="1770" width="218.96" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e104" value="채택/실제 게시 기록" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1787" y="1840" width="185.48" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e108" value="자료 조회" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2032" y="1662" width="91.16" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e110" value="근거/변경" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2052" y="1740" width="91.16" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e112" value="Task 조회" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2082" y="1942" width="99.8" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e114" value="사실/변경" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2102" y="2020" width="91.16" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e115" value="의미 구성 중 조회/변경 구독: Workspace&lt;br&gt;실행 직전 검사: Request Controller&lt;br&gt;원본 소유자는 양안 모두 동일" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2122" y="2090" width="384.56" height="78.9" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e118" value="미해결: 질문 전달 요청" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1367" y="2035" width="214.64" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e120" value="실제 게시 기록 반환" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1787" y="2085" width="185.48" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e121" value="Response Manager → Interaction Manager: 질문 표시/음성; 실제 게시 기록 반환&lt;br&gt;사용자 답변은 Interaction Manager → 상단 Request Controller로 새 입력" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1342" y="2250" width="784.52" height="54.6" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e124" value="발화/시점 전달; 신규/보완 관계는 미결정" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1377" y="530" width="374.12" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e126" value="유리: 명시한 조건을 유지하며 필요한 관계만 갱신&lt;br&gt;대가: 변경 언어/의존성 설계; 표현 밖 뜻은 질문&lt;br&gt;선택: 여러 번 보완하고 조건을 이어가는 대화" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=23;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1327" y="2365" width="567.82" height="123" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e127" value="공통 마무리: Request Controller 현재 검사 → Task Manager → Agent Gateway → Downstream Agent" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=22;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="2510" width="1201.72" height="35.7" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e128" value="접수/결과 반환 → Response Manager → Interaction Manager의 실제 표시/음성. 미해결이면 실행 대신 질문." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=22;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="2550" width="1245.28" height="35.7" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e129" value="검정: 공통 / 파랑: A 고유 / 초록: B 고유. 실선: 요청/전달 / 점선: 결과. 네모: 이름 / 원통: 상태 / 육각형: 외부 의존." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="2610" width="1205.76" height="31.650000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e130" value="같은 이름의 반복 상자는 동일 Component. 비교 부분의 책임을 펼친 그림. 별도 process 표기가 없으면 논리 분해. 모델 가중치는 한 벌; 이익은 조건부 설계 가설, 미측정." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="2650" width="1644.66" height="31.650000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e131" value="양안의 응답 생성도 필요하면 Response Manager → Model Access → 같은 Omni를 사용한다. 사건도에 요청/반환을 함께 표시." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="2690" width="1216.78" height="31.650000000000002" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
